---
// src/components/InstallationGuide.astro
---

<section class="py-24 relative z-10 bg-btc-dark overflow-hidden" id="instalacion">
    
    <div class="absolute inset-0 flex">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-btc-dark to-[#1a1a1c]"></div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-bl from-btc-dark to-[#0f1520]"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold mb-4 uppercase text-white">
                ELIGE TU <span class="text-btc-gold">CAMINO</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto text-lg">
                Compatible con todas las versiones y plataformas.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
            
            <div class="bg-[#151518] p-10 lg:p-14 relative group border-r border-white/5">
                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-btc-gold to-transparent opacity-50"></div>
                
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-btc-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">☕</div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-white">JAVA EDITION</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">PC (Windows, Mac, Linux)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-10">
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-3 font-medium">Conexión Directa (Sin Mods):</p>
                    <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 group-hover:border-btc-gold/30 transition-colors">
                        <code class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-btc-gold font-mono font-bold select-all truncate">rock-partition.gl.joinmc.link</code>
                        <button class="text-gray-500 hover:text-white" title="Copiar">
                           <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 border border-white/5">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                         <span class="bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded uppercase">Recomendado</span>
                         <h4 class="font-bold text-white">Mejorar Experiencia</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                        Aunque puedes entrar vanilla, recomendamos instalar nuestros mods para ver texturas personalizadas, shaders y mejorar el rendimiento.
                    </p>
                    
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                        <a href="https://modrinth.com/modpack/builtechraft-mods" target="_blank" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-[#1BD96A]/20 hover:bg-[#1BD96A]/30 text-[#1BD96A] font-bold text-sm transition-all border border-[#1BD96A]/20">
                            Modrinth App
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://discord.gg/4KzRH5DPzx" target="_blank" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-700/50 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-bold text-sm transition-all border border-white/10">
                            Descargar .7z
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-[#0f1219] p-10 lg:p-14 relative group">
                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-blue-500 to-transparent opacity-50"></div>

                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-blue-600/20 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">📱</div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-white">BEDROCK</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Móviles, Consolas, Windows 10/11</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <p class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Datos de Conexión:</p>
                    
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1 ml-1">IP del Servidor</div>
                        <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center justify-between group-hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-colors">
                            <code class="text-xl text-blue-400 font-mono font-bold select-all truncate">warning-fc.gl.at.ply.gg</code>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1 ml-1">Puerto</div>
                        <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center justify-between w-1/2 group-hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-colors">
                            <code class="text-xl text-blue-400 font-mono font-bold select-all">55879</code>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-8 p-4 bg-blue-900/10 rounded-lg border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-200 text-sm flex gap-3">
                        <span class="text-xl">💡</span>
                        <p>No necesitas descargar nada. Solo añade el servidor y conecta. Usamos GeyserMC para que juegues con usuarios de Java.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>